A string begins with a __fu'ivla__ if it does not begin with a ((Morphology: cmavo|cmavo)) or a __rafsi-string__ or a __slinku'i__, it does begin with a non-((Morphology: consonants|h)) ((Morphology: syllables|onset)), and consists of any number of ((Morphology: syllables|unstressed-syllable))s (possibly none), one ((Morphology: syllables|stressed-syllable)) and then a ((Morphology: syllables|final-syllable)).

A __rafsi-string__ consists of any number of ((Morphology: rafsi|y-less-rafsi)) (possibly none) followed by a ((Morphology: gismu|gismu)), a ((Morphology: rafsi|CVV-final-rafsi)), or a ((Morphology: rafsi|stressed-y-less-rafsi)) and a ((Morphology: rafsi|short-final-rafsi))

A __slinku'i__ consists of a ((Morphology: consonants|consonant)) followed by a __rafsi-string__.
